  "summary": { "en": [ "1 playground in Jim Taylor Park (UBC): a wooden play structure with a green spiral slide, a sloping cargo net and a coil climber, a log climbing wall, and a wooden frame with monkey bars. Not in the City of Vancouver open data; the position is where the survey photos were taken." ], "ja": [ "Jim Taylor Park（UBC）にある遊び場 1 か所。緑のらせんのすべり台、斜めの綱の網、らせんの登り棒が付いた木の複合遊具、丸太の登り壁、雲梯を渡した木の枠がある。市のオープンデータには無く、位置は現地調査の写真を撮った地点。" ] },
